OL,3,APrime minister visits Aberfan ahead of
OL,4,A60th anniversary of 'horrifying
OL,5,Atragedy'
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has met a
OL,8,Fsurvivor of the Aberfan disaster, as
OL,9,Fwell as others with connections to the
OL,10,Ftragedy, days ahead of the 60th
OL,11,Fanniversary.
OL,13,FBurnham visited the Aberfan memorial
OL,14,Fgarden on Monday morning alongside Jeff
OL,15,FEdwards, one of the last children to be
OL,16,Fbrought out alive from the wreckage,
OL,17,Fand Welsh Secretary Stephen Kinnock.
OL,19,F"It's been 60 years since one of the
OL,20,Fmost horrifying tragedies this country
OL,21,Fhas ever seen. All of those children
OL,22,Flost," Burnham said.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
