OL,3,APrime minister visits Aberfan ahead of
OL,4,A60th anniversary of 'horrifying
OL,5,Atragedy'
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn 21 October 1966, 116 children and 28
OL,8,Fadults were killed when a colliery
OL,9,Fspoil tip collapsed, catastrophically
OL,10,Fengulfing a primary school and
OL,11,Fsurrounding houses.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
